  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">An uptick in aviation‑related kinetic strikes increases operational friction and demonstrates physical network vulnerabilities, incentivizing state and proxy actors to mount offensive cyber operations against adversary AI systems and infrastructure as a lower‑cost means of escalation or counter‑pressure.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">gulf_maritime_flashpoint</data>
