  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">A drop in available tanker capacity stresses commodity traders' and shippers' financing and collateral positions, prompting dealers to pull back inventory financing and reduce risk intermediation, which lowers fixed‑income market liquidity.</data>
