  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained drop in transits through key maritime chokepoints raises freight costs, delivery lead times and risk premia in spot markets, pushing up global diesel spot prices.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">energy_market_fragment</data>
