  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">A sudden drop in fixed‑income market liquidity forces banks and non‑bank lenders to hoard cash and stop rolling short‑term shipping loans and working‑capital lines, causing shipowners to idle or sell tankers and reducing deployable tanker capacity.</data>
